<html>
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Team Reminder</title>
    <style
    >
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: {{branding.colors.textPrimary}};
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 20px;
        }
        .header {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 20px 0;
        }
        .logo {
            max-width: 150px;
            height: auto;
        }
        .content {
            background-color: {{branding.colors.backgroundPrimary}};
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        .button {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 12px 24px;
            background-color: {{branding.colors.accent}};
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 4px;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        .footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 20px;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: {{branding.colors.textSecondary}};
        }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="header">
        <img
          src="{{branding.logo.src}}"
          alt="{{branding.logo.altText}}"
          class="logo"
        />
      </div>

      <div class="content">
        <h2>Action Required: Team Reminder</h2>

        <p>Hello {{memberName}},</p>

        <p>This is a friendly reminder that you have pending actions in the team
          <strong>{{teamName}}</strong>
          on Jobready.</p>

        <p>Please take a moment to review and complete any pending tasks or
          updates required for your team.</p>

        <div style="text-align: center;">
          <a href="{{actionUrl}}" class="button">Go to Team Page</a>
        </div>

        <p>If you have any questions or need assistance, please don't hesitate
          to contact your team administrator.</p>

        <p>Best regards,<br />The Jobready Team</p>
      </div>

      <div class="footer">
        <p>This reminder was sent on {{formatDate reminderDate}}</p>
        <p>&copy; {{currentYear}} {{companyName}}. All rights reserved.</p>
        <p>
          <a href="{{branding.websiteUrl}}">Visit our website</a>
          |
          <a href="{{branding.socialLinks.twitter}}">Twitter</a>
          |
          <a href="{{branding.socialLinks.linkedin}}">LinkedIn</a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>